# {{ artifact.name }}

This is {{ base.repo }} with {{ artifact.n_routed | int }} of {{ artifact.n_routed_base | int }} routed experts kept in every decoder layer. The kept experts are **bit-exact**: their packed E2M1 weights and E8M0 scales are copied byte for byte from the base checkpoint at revision `{{ base.revision }}`.

The following parts are unchanged:
- the dense path (FP8 attention, compressor and indexer);
- the shared expert, the hyper-connections, the vision tower and aligner;
- the three DSpark/MTP layers.

The router's `gate.weight`, `gate.bias` and `gate.bias_vl` are sliced to the kept experts. Routing therefore re-normalises over the survivors exactly as the base model's router does.

This repository is the master for every derived build (NVFP4, GGUF / Thor).

## How the experts were chosen

- **Calibration corpus.** {{ corpus.tokens_total | int }} tokens in 8k sequences, plus a long-context pool of 32k-128k rows, token-balanced across general, multilingual, agentic, code, vision, math, science, finance and long-context text (corpus spec `{{ corpus.spec_hash | short }}`). It was run through the teacher layer by layer with Engram switched on. Only human-written or open-model text was used; no Claude-written text.
- **Ranking.** Candidate keep-sets were ranked by HOPE (pairwise co-activation with the REAP-sum diagonal), REAP-sum, routing mass, frequency and random anchors.
  - Each pool, and image tokens ranked separately on their own routing (`bias_vl`), protected its top experts at the measured protect-fraction knee ({{ arb.knee_A }}).
  - Super-Experts and position-sensitive / attention-sink experts were never pruned (long-context drift guard).
- **Arbitration.** The candidates were arbitrated by held-out top-32 KL against the teacher. The router re-selected over the survivors, evaluated in memory, on a screening split.
  - Winner: `{{ keepset.A.winner }}`.
  - Keep-set fingerprint: `{{ keepset.A.sha256 }}` (also in `reap_keepset.json`).

**Not healed.** Pruning inflates the routed sum, because weights re-normalise over fewer experts. A measured per-layer gain was {{ heal.status }}. An E8M0 scale can only move by powers of two, so this master ships **without** that gain. The NVFP4 and GGUF builds carry it.

